      "message": "If the return code for the invalid case will always be ERROR_UNKNOWN, feel free to remove the |status_code_if_invalid| parameter, and just bake this into the template definitions.\n\n(Seems like we always use ERROR_UNKNOWN for this class. I\u0027m just not sure if that will also be true for the other classes.)",
