        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-27T23:28:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is different per class. So, the wifi_chip.cpp for example would use |WifiStatusCode::ERROR_WIFI_CHIP_INVALID|.",
