      "author": {
        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-27T23:28:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We still need this helper function when we use it as a part of a pair.\n\nstd::make_pair({WifiStatusCode::SUCCESS, \"\"}, \u003cvalue\u003e) will not work.\n\nSo, it maybe cleaner to leave it everywhere?\nI\u0027ll change the implementation in wifi_status_util use the above though.",
